WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.232
A few numbers capture the impact.

00:00:02.312 --> 00:00:09.730
The unfolded moments agree with the true moments to
within two hundredths of a percent mean absolute error.

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:13.234
Two moments of the jet width are unfolded at once.

00:00:13.314 --> 00:00:16.457
The discriminator converges within ten epochs.

00:00:16.537 --> 00:00:21.993
The Gaussian study uses a million samples with a
three-to-one train-test split,

00:00:22.073 --> 00:00:28.720
and the entire set of notebooks reproduces in under
five minutes on a single Nvidia RTX6000 GPU.
